<title>USA: Omaha cattle steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said slaughter steers or heifers were steady.</p>
<p>Steers - select and choice 2-4 1050-1300 lbs 64.00-66.00, those at 66.00 mainly choice and relatively clean. Select 61.00-64.00.</p>
<p>Heifers - select to mostly choice 2-4 1000-1200 lbs 63.50- 65.50, some fairly clean 66.00. Select 60.00-63.50.</p>
</text>
